WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/driving/components/driving-dynamics/AutopilotSection.tsx — a driving-dynamics panel:
    GlassPanel(p-6) → h2 "Autopilot & Cruise"
                    → hasAny ? Grid(cols 1 / sm:3, gap 4)[ StatCard(Gauge,        "Current Speed",    fmtNumber(speed,0)  , unit=speed)
                                                           StatCard(Navigation,   "Cruise Set Speed", fmtNumber(cruise,0) , unit=speed)
                                                           StatCard(Navigation,   "Follow Distance",  followDistance      , no unit)   ]
                                : EmptyState("No cruise / autopilot telemetry received yet")
  Data: current speed from useVehicleState (SI m/s); cruise set speed from useSignalObservations('CruiseSetSpeed')
        latestNumeric (SI m/s); follow distance from useSignalObservations('CruiseFollowDistance') latestText, a proto
        enum "FollowDistance7" peeled by parseFollowDistance(/(\d+)\s*$/) to "7". Units via convertSpeedFromSI(unitPrefs.speed)
        — VehicleSpeed + CruiseSetSpeed are SI m/s, so they go DIRECTLY through the SI→display converter (no km/h step).
        hasAny = speedMps != null || cruiseSetMps != null || followDistance != null. Each individual value is "—" when absent.

